-label\">Stats</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>HalfElf_Commoner</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:HalfElf_Commoner+type:statscharacter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:HalfElf_Commoner+type:statscharacter\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div></section></aside>\n<b>Iza Blouin</b> is a sceptical reader of the <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Mouth_Gazette\" title=\"Baldur's Mouth Gazette\">Baldur's Mouth Gazette</a> during <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Three\" title=\"Act Three\">Act Three</a>.\n\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r356266\">.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{display:grid;margin:10px 4px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{padding:8px 16px;margin:auto}@media screen and (max-width:779px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-top:10px;padding:8px 2px;border-left:0!important;grid-row:2;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:3;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{justify-content:center!important}}@media screen and (min-width:780px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left{margin-left:10px;border-left:2px solid #3d3d3d!important;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-right:10px;border-left:0!important;border-right:2px solid #3d3d3d;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:3}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:1}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:2;grid-column:2}}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{margin-left:auto;margin-right:32px;font-size:smaller;font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{font-size:300%;font-family:serif;color:#3d3d3d;line-height:1em}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin{margin-bottom:auto;margin-right:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{margin-top:auto;margin-left:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text{font-style:italic}</style><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: center\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left\" style=\"display: inline-block; height: calc(70px + 2*4px); width: calc(70px + 2*4px); clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0% 50%); background: black;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; margin: 4px; width: 70px; height: 70px; clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0% 50%);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/eb/Portrait_Iza_Blouin.png/70px-Portrait_Iza_Blouin.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/eb/Portrait_Iza_Blouin.png/105px-Portrait_Iza_Blouin.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/eb/Portrait_Iza_Blouin.png/140px-Portrait_Iza_Blouin.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/eb/Portrait_Iza_Blouin.png/70px-Portrait_Iza_Blouin.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/eb/Portrait_Iza_Blouin.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><blockquote style=\"font-size: 100%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">Got a tip for you, mate. Don't believe everything you read.</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author\">— <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Iza Blouin</a></div><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Act_Three\">Act Three</span></h3>\n<p>Iza Blouin and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sharlz_Molar\" title=\"Sharlz Molar\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Portrait_Sharlz_Molar.png/25px-Portrait_Sharlz_Molar.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/97/Portrait_Sharlz_Molar.png/38px-Portrait_Sharlz_Molar.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/97/Portrait_Sharlz_Molar.png/50px-Portrait_Sharlz_Molar.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sharlz Molar\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Portrait_Sharlz_Molar.png/25px-Portrait_Sharlz_Molar.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/97/Portrait_Sharlz_Molar.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sharlz_Molar\" title=\"Sharlz Molar\">Sharlz Molar</a> are in <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate\" title=\"Baldur's Gate\">Baldur's Gate</a> next to the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Waypoint_Map_Icon.png/25px-Waypoint_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Waypoint_Map_Icon.png/38px-Waypoint_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Waypoint_Map_Icon.png/50px-Waypoint_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Waypoint Map Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Waypoint_Map_Icon.png/25px-Waypoint_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Waypoint_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Ancient_Sigil_Circle\" title=\"Ancient Sigil Circle\">Lower City waypoint</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-50&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-55</span>. Like many Baldurians, Iza and Sharlz are concerned about the state of the city, but neither are assured in the gazette's reporting of actual issues.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Idle_banter\">Idle banter</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-transcript\">\n<ul><li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Sharlz Molar</dt><dd>Gazette has a transcript of a conversation with <a href=\"/wiki/Enver_Gortash\" title=\"Enver Gortash\">Archduke Gortash</a>.</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Iza Blouin</dt><dd>What's he got to say for himself?</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Sharlz Molar</dt><dd>Lots of talk about the brilliant future of Baldur's Gate, city of steel and justice.</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Iza Blouin</dt><dd>Does he say anything about the horrible present of Baldur's Gate, city of crime and chaos?</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Sharlz Molar</dt><dd>No. He mostly avoids that topic.</dd></dl></li></ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-transcript\">\n<ul><li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Iza Blouin</dt><dd>Huh. Now <i>that's</i> something you don't see in the <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Mouth\" title=\"Baldur's Mouth\">Mouth</a> every day.&nbsp;<span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-condition\"><i>(If the Gazette publishes a positive article on the party)</i></span></dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Sharlz Molar</dt><dd>What's in this edition? More <a href=\"/wiki/Absolute\" title=\"Absolute\">Absolute</a> scaremongering?</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Iza Blouin</dt><dd>A positive headline. About a group of adventurers, no less.</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Sharlz Molar</dt><dd>Adventurers, necromancers, cults... Where's the reporting on <i>real</i> things? How do 'adventurers' help us normal folk? Not one bloody bit, that's how.</dd></dl></li></ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-transcript\">\n<ul><li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Iza Blouin</dt><dd><i>Adventurers aid Absolute</i>... Reckon there's any truth to that?&nbsp;<span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-condition\"><i>(If the Gazette publishes a negative article on the party)</i></span></dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Sharlz Molar</dt><dd>Truth? In the Baldur's Mouth Gazette?</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Iza Blouin</dt><dd>The Gazette can't be wrong <i>all</i> the time. Adventurers are basically mercenaries. Stands to reason some of them would side with a mad cult if it paid well enough.</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Sharlz Molar</dt><dd>What difference does it make? Cults come and go, and so do adventurers. The Gazette never prints anything that'll affect us regular folk. S'all a distraction.</dd></dl></li></ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-transcript\">\n<ul><li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Iza Blouin</dt><dd><i>Gods,</i> you'd hink the late Lord Gortash was a saint the way the Gazette goes on about him.&nbsp;<span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-condition\"><i>(If Enver Gortash is killed)</i></span></dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Sharlz Molar</dt><dd>Yeah, they've really made a meal out of the 'Death of Gortash' stuff.</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Iza Blouin</dt><dd>Won't tell us <i>how</i> Gortash died though, will they? Classic Baldur's Mouth.</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Sharlz Molar</dt><dd>Shoddy journalism indeed.</dd></dl></li></ul>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715061908\nCache ex